        "shortTitle": "5. Ordered Deletion of Ch...",
        "title": "Ordered Deletion of Chained Security Groups",
        "command": "# 1. Revoke the ingress rule referencing the frontend SG\naws ec2 revoke-security-group-ingress \\\n  --group-id \"${BACKEND_SG}\" \\\n  --protocol tcp \\\n  --port 80 \\\n  --source-group \"${FRONTEND_SG}\"\n\n# 2. Delete the groups\naws ec2 delete-security-group --group-id \"${BACKEND_SG}\"\naws ec2 delete-security-group --group-id \"${FRONTEND_SG}\"",
